14. Testing checklist
Before integrating this module into the main platform, verify:


Lecturer can only access questions within their authorized teaching assignments.

Lecturer can create, view, edit and archive draft questions.

Invalid question configurations are rejected.

Single-choice questions accept exactly one correct option.

Multiple-choice questions support multiple correct options.

Numeric and text answers support configurable marking rules.

Questions cannot be edited after being used in a locked or published examination.

Duplicate questions are not attached to an assessment.

Assessment marks are recalculated after questions are added or removed.

Student endpoints never return answer keys or marking configurations.

Every question change is recorded in the audit log.

Import files are validated before database insertion.
